cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Digital Consumption and Political Alignment: Evidence from Mobile Data Across Two European Elections in France"
abstract: >-
  Code and commune-level analytical data for a population-scale study relating
  mobile digital-service consumption to political alignment across the 2019 and
  2024 European elections in metropolitan France, using Dirichlet regression on
  per-commune scaled revealed comparative advantage (sRCA) of mobile services.
